  (text "Ratiometric windows: NTC=103AT-2; nominal acceptance about 1.1-43.2 C from the published R/T table.\nOpen or shorted sensor inhibits charging. Tolerance and actual switching points require bench verification.\nThe charger has an additional dedicated TS thermistor; this window does not replace pack protection."
